Critical Adjustments for the Replit Environment:
The "Open in Browser" Button:
In Replit, the small "Preview" pane often blocks microphone access. Click the
"Open in New Tab"
button at the very top right. This gives the app its own dedicated URL, which usually triggers the "Allow Microphone" popup that the preview pane hides.
iOS Mute Switch:
If you are on an iPhone, the physical "Silent" switch on the side of your phone can actually block the Web Audio API from outputting sound (SAGE voice), even if the visuals are working.
