I understand the frustration\u2014if it worked before and isn't firing now, the
AudioContext
has likely entered a "locked" state that a simple tap isn't clearing because of how the code is currently handling the handshake.
In the latest mobile browser updates (2025-2026), the "Init" button must be the
exact and only
trigger that creates the audio stream. If the code tries to look for the mic before the user tap is "verified" by the OS, it permanently kills the process for that session.
