Why it likely "broke":
Tab Sleep:
If you left the Replit tab open in the background, the browser "revoked" the mic permission to save battery. The old code didn't know how to ask again without a full refresh.
Ghost Context:
Sometimes a "suspended" audio context stays in the phone's memory. The
await audioCtx.close()
line in this new version kills that ghost so a fresh one can start.
Instructions for the Reset:
